## Negocia el formato de la respuesta con `Accept`.

import portus

const PORT as int is 3000

weave data with context as ref to portus.Context into result of void to portus.HttpError:
    let chosen as maybe string is calling portus.best with context, ["application/json", "text/html", "text/plain"]
    if kind as string is chosen:
        if kind == "application/json":
            calling context.send_body_with_type with "application/json", "{\"kind\":\"json\"}"
            return calling portus.ok_void
        if kind == "text/html":
            calling context.send_body_with_type with "text/html; charset=utf-8", "<b>html</b>"
            return calling portus.ok_void
        calling context.send_text with "texto"
        return calling portus.ok_void
    calling context.set_status with 406
    calling context.send_text with "no acepto nada de eso"
    return calling portus.ok_void

weave main into int:
    var app as portus.Application is calling portus.new_application
    let r1 as result of void to portus.PatternError is calling portus.get with sigil of app, "/data", data
    let served as result of int to string is calling portus.serve with sigil of app, PORT
    return served or else 1
